    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d184">

                <pb facs="0406" n="386" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg386"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord
                        Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-07-10"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 10, 1863, </date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: In response to your note of the 3d
                    instant, enclosing a protestmade by Mr. E. J. Locke, master of the brig Isabella
                    Thompson, of Halifax, Nova Scotia, against the capture of that vessel by the
                    United States ship-of-war United States, I have the honor to enclose to you the
                    copy of a letter of yesterday, addressed to this department by the Secretary of
                    the Navy.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be your very obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD. </signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d184-a1.xml" xpointer="d184-a1"/>
            </div>
